    "@es": "Expresar posesión",
    "@en": "Express possession"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Have got** expresa posesión. Usa **have got** con **I/you/we/they** y **has got** con **he/she/it**. En este uso, las formas cortas son **I've got** y **she's got**.",
     "@en": "**Have got** expresses possession. Use **have got** with **I/you/we/they** and **has got** with **he/she/it**. In this use, the short forms are **I've got** and **she's got**."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Para preguntar, coloca **have/has** antes del sujeto: **Have you got a bicycle?** / **Has your brother got your address?**",
     "@en": "To ask, place **have/has** before the subject: **Have you got a bicycle?** / **Has your brother got your address?**"
    }
   ]
  },
